 misión, comienza la verdadera misión de Gero: enamorar a Himekawa después de su buena acción.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11713940/screencap/69de527a82394.jpg","released":"2026-04-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39122769:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"4. El experto del sonido","overview":"Gero tendrá que proteger a la heredera de un CEO de un asesino contratado para acabar con su vida.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11713941/screencap/69e78b66e3cab.jpg","released":"2026-04-28T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39122769:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"5. El señor Chladni","overview":"Gero intentará salvar a Shiori de la amenaza del experto del sonido, quien inició el ataque en el bosque.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11713942/screencap/69f0cbda4dd8b.jpg","released":"2026-05-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39122769:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. Conmigo","overview":"Panicked students try to sacrifice Ureshino, and stopping Naruko is the only way to make them see reason.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11713943/screencap/69fa01ef034f8.jpg","released":"2026-05-12T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39122769:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. La boda del experto de los insectos","overview":"Gero acude a la boda de su amigo acompañado de Mei, pero surgen problemas con alguien que busca venganza.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11713944/screencap/6a0c750b2224c.jpg","released":"2026-05-19T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt39122769:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. El cazador de sicarios","overview":"Hikaru y Mei conocen a una experta que pide ayuda para protegerla del cazador de sicarios que quiere matarla.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11713945/screencap/6a0c792b9c62f.jpg","released":"2026-05-26T12:0